# The calling server deploy does not need native apps, simulator builds, tests,
# operator scripts, or local credentials. Vercel supplies runtime secrets.
# Vercel applies this to the website's Git builds too. The folder rules start with /
# so they match only the top-level folders: a bare ios/ also removed the website's
# app/(site)/pilot/ios page, which then served a 404.
/ios/
/tests/
/scripts/
.env*
!.env.example
/.app-review/
node_modules/
.next/
.git/
*.tsbuildinfo
